{"author":{"handle":"malaiwah","is_registry_maintainer":true,"name":"malaiwah","role":"toolchain-author","url":"https://huggingface.co/malaiwah"},"cost":{"basis":"1x H200 spot at $1.99/h. No invoice was captured for these two runs, so no single figure is asserted here; the measured decode is 10.94 ms/matrix over 36,288 matrices and a full-panel cold run projects at ~2.8 h (~$5.6), against ~2.37 h x 8 GPUs x 5 cold runs for the sealed lane.","usd_per_measurement":null},"cross_refs":{"local_ai_registry":{"match_confidence":"unverified","model_id":null,"model_instance_id":null,"url":null}},"disclosures":[{"affects_comparability":true,"code":"non_sealed_lane","detail":"This is the streaming lane, not the sealed-ep8 lane. It scores the same sealed panel against the same stored teacher logits on ONE GPU by streaming one layer of routed experts at a time, and it emulates the sealed run's 8-way expert-parallel partition inside a single process. Numbers from this lane sit beside the sealed lane's, never in place of them.","severity":"caveat"},{"affects_comparability":true,"code":"local_device_reduction_order","detail":"The one op that differs is the routed-expert combine, in each of 42 layers. The sealed run rounded each rank's partial to bf16 and let NCCL sum the ~5 nonzero partials in an order set by the 8-GPU NVSwitch topology; a single process cannot reproduce that order, so this lane sums in fp32 (--reduce-order fp32). Because top-8-of-288 routing is discontinuous in the hidden state, an ULP-scale difference there flips marginal routing decisions downstream -- which is why the tokenwise KL array differs from the sealed one even though the panel mean is within 8.5e-06 nats.","severity":"caveat"}],"hardware":{"gpu":"H200","gpu_count":1,"note":"one device; the tp4/tp8 strings in the profile names describe the sealed partition being emulated, not a real world size","tensor_parallel":null},"id":"pipeline--malaiwah.glm53-stream-packed-kld","implementation":{"container_digest":null,"container_image":null,"dependencies":{"sealed_checkpoint_identity_sha256":"a8668be3592493035e98a52994e0e3c43548a9757eadb79f7ae939f2f32de1c1"},"entrypoint":"tools/stream_score.py (single-device capture) -> tools/k6_kld_report.py --profile k6-stream (unmodified fp64 scorer)","file_sha256":null,"repository":null,"revision":null,"runtime_reader_sha256":null},"lane":{"bridge":{"compared_to_lane":"sealed-ep8","delta_mean_kld":-8.495843104593809e-06,"evidence":[{"kind":"receipt_file","note":"malaiwah.glm53-streaming-measurement-verdict.v1: scored the sealed K6 surface (student and sealed checkpoint_identity_sha256 both a8668be3...), 25 per-window pairs, cross-run payload bitwise identical over 2 cold runs","sha256":"e205c14f5700417b32f4cb4a2d6724f3bf416ffc9d4cca3f129c18b0a0e7b005","uri":"receipts/malaiwah/stream-k6-verdict.json"},{"kind":"hf_file","note":"the same file, published","sha256":"e205c14f5700417b32f4cb4a2d6724f3bf416ffc9d4cca3f129c18b0a0e7b005","uri":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/malaiwah/quant-fidelity-registry/resolve/main/receipts/malaiwah/stream-k6-verdict.json"}],"max_abs_per_window_delta":0.00028735280093581186,"panel_ref":"panel--glm53.brandonmusic.final25","publishable_as_reproduction":false,"sealed_measurement_ref":"measurement--glm53.k6-6bpw.brandonmusic-final25","tokenwise_kld_sha256_matches_sealed":false,"verdict":"LARGER_DELTA_SEE_DISCLOSURE","windows_compared":25},"device_count":1,"expert_parallel_emulated":true,"expert_parallel_world_size":8,"name":"streaming","reduce_order":"fp32"},"name":"malaiwah GLM-5.3-Flash streaming single-GPU KLD scorer (EP8 emulated, reduce-order fp32)","numerics":{"accumulation_dtype":"fp64","determinism_controls":["cold_process_per_run","fixed_batch_shape"],"two_pass":null,"vocab_chunk":null},"roles":["replay","scorer","aggregator"],"schema_version":"quant-fidelity-registry/v1","sources":[{"kind":"receipt_file","note":"malaiwah.glm53-k6-stream-packed-kld-summary.v1, profile k6-stream-tp4","sha256":"7ee0de697d0